    "title": "Popular Manchester, New Hampshire Restaurant is Permanently Closed - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Manchester\nPopular Manchester, New Hampshire Restaurant is Permanently Closed\nBy Sarah Sullivan,\n2 hours agoThis is sad. We barely knew this place and now, it's closed. It was announced on Facebook this past weekend that The Birch on Elm has closed for good. The owner, Andre Scott, said thank you to the Manchester community for sharing special occasions with them. He also made reference to the challenges that the restaurant had and how he was unwilling to compromise on the quality of food, safety or the guests experience.",
